                students.
              </p>

              <ul class="exp-bullets">
                <li>
                  Built 3 Android applications from scratch and maintained 2
                  production applications.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Contributed to scaling the Melvano app to 100K+ downloads and
                  10K+ active installs.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Developed maintainable Android applications using Kotlin,
                  MVVM, MVP, Jetpack components, Retrofit, and Firebase.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Improved app load time by approximately 20–30% on low-end
                  devices.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver reliable
                  features and improve app performance and stability.
                </li>
                <li>Recognized as Employee of the Quarter twice.</li>
              </ul>

              <div class="exp-tags">
                <span>Kotlin</span>
                <span>Jetpack Compose</span>
                <span>MVVM</span>
                <span>MVP</span>
                <span>Firebase</span>
                <span>Retrofit</span>
                <span>REST APIs</span>
