                  <h4 class="exp-company">Apptunix</h4>
                </div>
                <span class="exp-badge">Training + Full-time</span>
              </div>

              <p class="exp-summary">
                Started my professional Android development journey, working on
                mobile applications and building a strong foundation in Android
                engineering.
              </p>

              <ul class="exp-bullets">
                <li>
                  Completed Android development training and progressed into a
                  full-time development role.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Developed Android applications using Kotlin, Android SDK, and
                  MVVM architecture.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Integrated REST APIs, Firebase services, Google Maps,
                  notifications, and third-party SDKs.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Worked on app testing, bug fixing, performance improvements,
                  and production maintenance.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Contributed to Google Play Store releases and ongoing
                  application support.
                </li>
              </ul>

              <div class="exp-tags">
                <span>Kotlin</span>
